than one person.\n\nSentiment\n\nTopics\n\nTopic:\n\nScience and Technology > Social Sciences > Economics\n\nScore:\n\n0.536\n\nCode:\n\n20000745\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000745\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ8134\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\neconomics\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n9.9\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n59.9\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n13.5\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n10.1\n\nSMOG Index\n\n12\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n9.5\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n4.3\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n5\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n17\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n23\n\n## Donald Trump\n\n00:00:37-00:01:04 (28 sec)\n\nNo Signal (0.915)\n\nWe had transgender for everybody, men in women's sports, crime ravaging our cities, and the whole world was laughing at us as a nation, but not anymore. Two years ago, our country was dead. Now, we are the hottest country anywhere in the world. America is respected like we have never been respected before.\n\nSentiment\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n7.8\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n63.1\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n11.3\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n10.7\n\nSMOG Index\n\n11.3\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n6.5\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n4.2\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n3.4\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n12\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n14\n\n## Donald Trump\n\n00:01:04-00:01:31 (27 sec)\n\nNo Signal (0.438)\n\nWe have more money being invested in the United States than at any time in the history of our country. More Americans are working today than ever before. This week, it was announced that inflation saw the largest monthly decline in more than six years, just happened. It was just given out. The media reported it and we accept it, the best in six years.\n\nSentiment\n\nTopics\n\nTopic:\n\nEconomy, Business and Finance > Economy\n\nScore:\n\n0.541\n\nCode:\n\n20000344\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000344\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ159810\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\neconomy\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nScience and Technology > Social Sciences > Economics\n\nScore:\n\n0.536\n\nCode:\n\n20000745\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000745\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ8134\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\neconomics\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n6.7\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n70\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n8.3\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n9.6\n\nSMOG Index\n\n10\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n5.4\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n3.6\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n3.6\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n12\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n17\n\n## Donald Trump\n\n00:01:31-00:01:58 (27 sec)\n\nNo Signal (0.379)\n\nThe tax cuts in our Great, Big, Beautiful Bill are saving hardworking families thousands and thousands of dollars, like with the provisions, no tax on tips, no tax on overtime and no tax on Social Security for our great seniors, along with the interest deduction on a loan used to purchase a car, but only if that car is made in America.\n\nSentiment\n\nTopics\n\nTopic:\n\nScience and Technology > Social Sciences > Economics\n\nScore:\n\n0.536\n\nCode:\n\n20000745\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000745\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ8134\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\neconomics\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n12\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n17\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n19\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n9.7\n\nSMOG Index\n\n12\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n12\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n5.6\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n5\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n10\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n16\n\n## Donald Trump\n\n00:01:58-00:02:27 (29 sec)\n\nNo Signal (0.426)\n\nAnd a 100 percent expensing for our job-creating businesses. Our stock markets are at their highest point in many years, but we can actually say of all time. And your 401-Ks, pensions and retirement accounts are setting records every single day, the highest in history. For years, we paid the highest price for prescription drugs anywhere in the world.\n\nSentiment\n\nTopics\n\nTopic:\n\nLabour > Retirement\n\nScore:\n\n0.685\n\nCode:\n\n20000531\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000531\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ946865\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\nretirement\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nHealth\n\nScore:\n\n0.536\n\nCode:\n\n7000000\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/07000000\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ12147\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\nhealth\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nScience and Technology > Social Sciences > Economics\n\nScore:\n\n0.536\n\nCode:\n\n20000745\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000745\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ8134\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\neconomics\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nLabour > Retirement > Pension\n\nScore:\n\n0.509\n\nCode:\n\n20000532\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000532\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ156223\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\npension\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nEconomy, Business and Finance > Economy\n\nScore:\n\n0.505\n\nCode:\n\n20000344\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000344\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ159810\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\neconomy\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n7.6\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n67.9\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n12\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n11\n\nSMOG Index\n\n11.8\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n7.7\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n3.9\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n4\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n12\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n18\n\n## Donald Trump\n\n00:02:27-00:03:04 (37 sec)\n\nNo Signal (0.902)\n\nNow we pay the lowest price under my Most Favored Nations policy, because I was able to get the rest of the world and the pharmaceutical companies to act responsibly. Drug prices are coming down by 70, 80 and 90 percent. Trumprx.gov, this will ultimately reduce the cost of health care. You have to go to trumprx.gov and take advantage of it. But the cost of health care is coming way down because of what we've done with prescription drugs.\n\nSentiment\n\nTopics\n\nTopic:\n\nHealth\n\nScore:\n\n0.808\n\nCode:\n\n7000000\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/07000000\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ12147\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\nhealth\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nEconomy, Business and Finance > Products and Services > Healthcare Industry > Pharmaceutical\n\nScore:\n\n0.723\n\nCode:\n\n20000223\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000223\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ507443\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\npharmaceutical industry\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nHealth > Health Treatment and Procedure > Health Care Approach\n\nScore:\n\n0.614\n\nCode:\n\n20000470\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000470\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ11190\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\nmedicine\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nHealth > Health Treatment and Procedure > Prescription Drug\n\nScore:\n\n0.606\n\nCode:\n\n20000468\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000468\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ1643563\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\nprescription drug\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nEconomy, Business and Finance > Products and Services > Healthcare Industry\n\nScore:\n\n0.515\n\nCode:\n\n20001354\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20001354\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ15067276\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\nhealth care industry\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nEconomy, Business and Finance > Economy > Macro Economics > Prices\n\nScore:\n\n0.511\n\nCode:\n\n20000382\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000382\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ160151\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\nprice\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n4.7\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n82.5\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n8.1\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n9\n\nSMOG Index\n\n9\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n4.2\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n3.9\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n3.6\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n17\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n19\n\n## Donald Trump\n\n00:03:04-00:03:29 (26 sec)\n\nNo Signal (0.573)\n\nAnd with Trump accounts, every child in America now has access to a tax free investment account to save for their future. Billions and billions of dollars are being invested, put in by companies and individuals to take care of our children, so that at age 18, they will have potentially hundreds of thousands of dollars in their account, and they'll get off to a great start in life.\n\nSentiment\n\nTopics\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics\n\nScore:\n\n0.68\n\nCode:\n\n11000000\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/11000000\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ7163\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\npolitics\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics > Government\n\nScore:\n\n0.574\n\nCode:\n\n20000593\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000593\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ7188\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\ngovernment\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n12\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n48\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n18.4\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n10.2\n\nSMOG Index\n\n12\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n12\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n4\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n5\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n10\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n17\n\n## Donald Trump\n\n00:03:29-00:03:54 (25 sec)\n\nWeak (1.153)\n\nSo for that, go to trumpaccounts.gov and sign up your child or any child you'd like to sign up. Our previously wide open borders have been transformed into the most secure borders in the history of our country, with zero illegal aliens being admitted to the United States in the past 14 months. That is zero.\n\nSentiment\n\nTopics\n\nTopic:\n\nSociety\n\nScore:\n\n0.574\n\nCode:\n\n14000000\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/14000000\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ8425\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\nsociety\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nScience and Technology > Social Sciences > Psychology\n\nScore:\n\n0.536\n\nCode:\n\n20000753\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000753\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ9418\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\npsychology\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nSociety > Immigration\n\nScore:\n\n0.536\n\nCode:\n\n20000771\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000771\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ131288\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\nimmigration\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n6.9\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n70.7\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n9.9\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n9.4\n\nSMOG Index\n\n10.8\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n5.9\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n4.3\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n3.6\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n13\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n15\n\n## Donald Trump\n\n00:03:54-00:04:21 (27 sec)\n\nWeak (1.35)\n\nNobody thought it was possible. We had the worst border in the history of our country, and now we have the best. Crime is plummeting nationwide, with the murder rate at its lowest level since 1900, or more than 125 years ago. We're making a record investment in our armed forces, and we have the strongest and most powerful military by far anywhere in the world.\n\nSentiment\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n7.5\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n70.9\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n11.4\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n9.3\n\nSMOG Index\n\n11.8\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n6.9\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n3.2\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n4.5\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n10\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n22\n\n## Donald Trump\n\n00:04:21-00:04:45 (24 sec)\n\nWeak (1.129)\n\nI built it during my first term and, unfortunately, we're forced to use it now. We won in Venezuela, which is now working with us to produce millions and millions of barrels of oil. We are likewise winning big in Iran, and you will see the fruits of that labor very, very shortly. America is back and doing really well.\n\nSentiment\n\nTopics\n\nTopic:\n\nEconomy, Business and Finance > Products and Services > Energy and Resource\n\nScore:\n\n0.536\n\nCode:\n\n20000256\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000256\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ2151621\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\nenergy industry\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nScience and Technology > Social Sciences > Economics\n\nScore:\n\n0.536\n\nCode:\n\n20000745\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000745\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ8134\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\neconomics\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n7.6\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n67.5\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n10\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n8.7\n\nSMOG Index\n\n10.8\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n5.7\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n4.2\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n4.1\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n13\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n20\n\n## Donald Trump\n\n00:04:45-00:05:15 (30 sec)\n\nNo Signal (0.057)\n\nBut we still have a major challenge that must be urgently addressed, because no country can be great without fair and honest elections. You have to trust your country because, if there can be no trust, there can be no greatness. And that's very simple -- no trust, no greatness. For many years I've called for bold, swift and decisive action to protect the integrity of America's elections.\n\nSentiment\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n8.2\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n66.1\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n9.7\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n11.3\n\nSMOG Index\n\n10.3\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n8.7\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n3.9\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n4.1\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n13\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n17\n\n## Donald Trump\n\n00:05:15-00:05:40 (24 sec)\n\nNo StressLens\n\nEvery American deserves to know that, when they cast their vote, that vote will be counted accurately in a system, and that is to make that system secure. One where cheating and interference are not just difficult, but virtually impossible. Unfortunately, the system we have today falls catastrophically short of that standard.\n\nSentiment\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n11.4\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n44.4\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n12.3\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n12\n\nSMOG Index\n\n12\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n11.5\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n5.7\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n4.1\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n16\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n16\n\n## Donald Trump\n\n00:05:40-00:06:07 (27 sec)\n\nNo Signal (0.081)\n\nTonight, I'm announcing the immediate declassification and release of critical intelligence, revealing shocking vulnerabilities in our election infrastructure. This evidence shows that the election system we have dangerously exposes and really exposes, like levels never thought possible, to hacking, exploitation, and foreign interference.\n\nSentiment\n\nTopics\n\nTopic:\n\nCrime, Law and Justice > Crime\n\nScore:\n\n0.617\n\nCode:\n\n20000082\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000082\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ83267\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\ncrime\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nCrime, Law and Justice > Crime > Cyber Crime\n\nScore:\n\n0.544\n\nCode:\n\n20000086\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000086\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ29137\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\ncybercrime\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nEconomy, Business and Finance > Products and Services > Computing and Information Technology\n\nScore:\n\n0.536\n\nCode:\n\n20000225\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000225\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ179310\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\ncomputing\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics > Government > Espionage and Intelligence\n\nScore:\n\n0.536\n\nCode:\n\n20000605\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000605\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ165950\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\nespionage\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nScience and Technology\n\nScore:\n\n0.536\n\nCode:\n\n13000000\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/13000000\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ34104\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\nscience and technology\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics\n\nScore:\n\n0.508\n\nCode:\n\n11000000\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/11000000\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ7163\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\npolitics\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n12\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n0\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n19\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n12\n\nSMOG Index\n\n12\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n12\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n9.1\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n5\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n22\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n24\n\n## Donald Trump\n\n00:06:07-00:06:49 (42 sec)\n\nNo StressLens\n\nJust as disturbingly, this vital information has for many years been covered up and hidden from you, the American people -- our beautiful, our great American people. But that all changes right now. The documents we will release starting tonight have been gathered by the White House Government Transparency Task Force, a great group of people, along with the staff of the president's Intelligence Advisory Board, supported by our top intelligence agency chiefs who have all personally reviewed the findings we are presenting this evening and fully confirmed their authenticity.\n\nSentiment\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n12\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n31.3\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n17.3\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n12\n\nSMOG Index\n\n12\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n12\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n5.9\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n5\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n25\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n29\n\n## Donald Trump\n\n00:06:49-00:07:13 (24 sec)\n\nNo Signal (0.164)\n\nYou can see these documents for yourself at whitehouse.gov, that's whitehouse.gov, go check it out. Our purpose in disclosing this information is not to weaken confidence in election, but to earn that confidence by confronting vulnerabilities and correcting them very, very quickly, and that's what we're doing.\n\nSentiment\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n8.7\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n54.6\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n13.9\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n12\n\nSMOG Index\n\n12\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n9\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n5.4\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n3.5\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n15\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n17\n\n## Donald Trump\n\n00:07:13-00:07:40 (28 sec)\n\nNo Signal (0.954)\n\nThe documents cover five major areas of concern. First, they show that, over a period of years, starting during the 2020 election cycle, the People's Republic of China carried out what is believed to be the largest compromise of election data in history, resulting in China's illicit acquisition of 220 million US voter files.\n\nSentiment\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n12\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n36.9\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n18.2\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n12\n\nSMOG Index\n\n12\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n12\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n7.5\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n5\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n21\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n24\n\n## Donald Trump\n\n00:07:40-00:08:10 (30 sec)\n\nNo Signal (0.287)\n\nThat information includes names, addresses, phone numbers, political party preferences and other sensitive data that would be needed to register to vote and engage in other nefarious activities, which is exactly what was happening. This data loss presents an unprecedented election security nightmare. The intelligence even shows that China assigned a data exploitation unit specifically to this new project.\n\nSentiment\n\nTopics\n\nTopic:\n\nScience and Technology\n\nScore:\n\n0.646\n\nCode:\n\n13000000\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/13000000\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ34104\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\nscience and technology\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n12\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n16.2\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n18\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n12\n\nSMOG Index\n\n12\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n12\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n7.9\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n5\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n26\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n28\n\n## Donald Trump\n\n00:08:10-00:08:39 (29 sec)\n\nNo Signal (0.759)\n\nCompounding the travesty, the second set of documents we are releasing reveals that members of the Deep State -- a very, very famous group of people, in many cases -- in our intelligence agency, worked to actively suppress and downplay information about the extent of China's sinister election meddling, covering it up from both the president and the American people like nobody thought was possible.\n\nSentiment\n\nTopics\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics\n\nScore:\n\n0.572\n\nCode:\n\n11000000\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/11000000\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ7163\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\npolitics\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nSociety > Values > Ethics\n\nScore:\n\n0.536\n\nCode:\n\n20000814\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000814\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ9465\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\nethics\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n12\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n0\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n19\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n12\n\nSMOG Index\n\n12\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n12\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n8.4\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n5\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n21\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n26\n\n## Donald Trump\n\n00:08:39-00:09:07 (28 sec)\n\nWeak (1.142)\n\nUS spy agencies began learning about the compromise of voter registration files in 2020, when they discovered that tens of millions of voter data -- think of that, tens of millions of voters data -- in 18 states have been bought, stolen or hacked by China. Yet those responsible for sounding the alarm instead kept the information secret and hidden.\n\nSentiment\n\nTopics\n\nTopic:\n\nScience and Technology\n\nScore:\n\n0.646\n\nCode:\n\n13000000\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/13000000\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ34104\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\nscience and technology\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics\n\nScore:\n\n0.575\n\nCode:\n\n11000000\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/11000000\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ7163\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\npolitics\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nEconomy, Business and Finance > Products and Services > Computing and Information Technology\n\nScore:\n\n0.536\n\nCode:\n\n20000225\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000225\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ179310\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\ncomputing\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n12\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n44.7\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n17.1\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n12\n\nSMOG Index\n\n12\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n12\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n6.1\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n5\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n17\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n18\n\n## Donald Trump\n\n00:09:07-00:09:43 (36 sec)\n\nNo Signal (0.466)\n\nThey did not disclose to me as president or to anyone else. And to the best of our knowledge, they did not inform Congress. In fact, all they kept saying is, this is the most secure election in the history of our country -- a standard, very pat line that was divvied out to say. The cover up of this colossal security breach is even more disturbing in light of the additional information showing that China engaged in other election-related activities to undermine my first administration and our 2020 campaign.\n\nSentiment\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n11.4\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n53.3\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n14.3\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n10.8\n\nSMOG Index\n\n12\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n11.1\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n5.3\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n5\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n24\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n26\n\n## Donald Trump\n\n00:09:43-00:10:18 (34 sec)\n\nWeak (1.299)\n\nThey did not want -- and they just didn't want it. They fought like hell not to have it, Donald Trump to win, and for good reason. As the documents we are releasing show, CIA reporting explicitly stated, and I quote, in mid-2018, the Chinese Communist Party's policy was to leverage all domestic and foreign elements that were opposed to the US president in an effort to reduce the US president's votes and make him resign or prevent his reelection.\n\nSentiment\n\nTopics\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics > Government\n\nScore:\n\n0.717\n\nCode:\n\n20000593\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000593\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ7188\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\ngovernment\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics\n\nScore:\n\n0.68\n\nCode:\n\n11000000\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/11000000\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ7163\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\npolitics\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics > Government > Heads of State\n\nScore:\n\n0.574\n\nCode:\n\n20000610\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000610\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ48352\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\nhead of state\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n11.6\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n59.2\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n15.2\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n10\n\nSMOG Index\n\n12\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n12\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n6.8\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n5\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n28\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n30\n\n## Donald Trump\n\n00:10:18-00:10:42 (25 sec)\n\nNo Signal (0.409)\n\nIsn't that nice? Also, in mid-2018, China was working to influence the results of the US midterm elections and later the results of the 2020 presidential election itself. Separately, in mid-2019, the Chinese government's strategy against the United States was focused on undermining domestic confidence in the US president.\n\nSentiment\n\nTopics\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics\n\nScore:\n\n0.687\n\nCode:\n\n11000000\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/11000000\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ7163\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\npolitics\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics > Election\n\nScore:\n\n0.601\n\nCode:\n\n20000574\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000574\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ40231\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\npublic election\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics > Government\n\nScore:\n\n0.575\n\nCode:\n\n20000593\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000593\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ7188\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\ngovernment\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics > Government > Heads of State\n\nScore:\n\n0.574\n\nCode:\n\n20000610\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000610\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ48352\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\nhead of state\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n10.9\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n46.9\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n15.4\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n12\n\nSMOG Index\n\n12\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n10.3\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n8\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n4.5\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n23\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n22\n\n## Donald Trump\n\n00:10:42-00:11:12 (30 sec)\n\nNo Signal (0.677)\n\nThey wanted to just make you sound like your president wasn't so hot, when actually your president has done a great job. And they did everything possible to do exactly that. Going on this document says, and this is by the CIA, the strategy included efforts to use Chinese contacts with big US companies to influence US business leaders to turn against the president of the United States of America.\n\nSentiment\n\nTopics\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics > Government\n\nScore:\n\n0.673\n\nCode:\n\n20000593\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000593\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ7188\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\ngovernment\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nPolit