erable our elections continue to be, we are releasing the results of a stunning investigation by the Department of Homeland Security. According to the DHS review, state voter rolls and public records, they identified approximately 278,000 non-citizens who are registered to vote in federal elections.\n\nSentiment\n\nTopics\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics > Government\n\nScore:\n\n0.717\n\nCode:\n\n20000593\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000593\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ7188\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\ngovernment\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics\n\nScore:\n\n0.68\n\nCode:\n\n11000000\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/11000000\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ7163\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\npolitics\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nCrime, Law and Justice > Law Enforcement\n\nScore:\n\n0.574\n\nCode:\n\n20000129\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000129\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ44554\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\nlaw enforcement\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics > Election\n\nScore:\n\n0.574\n\nCode:\n\n20000574\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000574\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ40231\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\npublic election\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics > Government > defense > Security Measures (defense) > National Security\n\nScore:\n\n0.574\n\nCode:\n\n20000604\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000604\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ258307\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\nnational security\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n12\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n21\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n19\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n12\n\nSMOG Index\n\n12\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n12\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n7.4\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n5\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n20\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n25\n\n## Donald Trump\n\n00:19:01-00:19:29 (28 sec)\n\nNo Signal (0.65)\n\nSince Democrat states refuse to share their voter files the real number is actually much higher than that. Yet even this limited analysis found more than a quarter of a million foreigners illegally registered to vote. Put together, these disclosures reveal an election system so broken and so vulnerable that no one can possibly defend it. It is not defensible.\n\nSentiment\n\nTopics\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics\n\nScore:\n\n0.588\n\nCode:\n\n11000000\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/11000000\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ7163\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\npolitics\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics > Election\n\nScore:\n\n0.536\n\nCode:\n\n20000574\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000574\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ40231\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\npublic election\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n10.7\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n45\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n14.7\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n12\n\nSMOG Index\n\n12\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n9.4\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n5\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n4.4\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n16\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n23\n\n## Donald Trump\n\n00:19:29-00:19:55 (27 sec)\n\nNo Signal (0.685)\n\nHundreds of millions of US voter files are in the hands of foreign governments. Our machines and ballot counting systems are exposed to hacking and manipulation and corruption. China and other countries have been trying to meddle in our elections. Evidence of fraud has been buried. Hundreds of thousands of non-citizens and dead people are listed and active on the voter rolls.\n\nSentiment\n\nTopics\n\nTopic:\n\nCrime, Law and Justice > Crime > Fraud\n\nScore:\n\n0.838\n\nCode:\n\n20000097\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000097\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ28813\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\nfraud\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nCrime, Law and Justice > Crime > Corruption\n\nScore:\n\n0.689\n\nCode:\n\n20000093\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000093\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ366\n\nWikidata