uch more than one month.\n\nSentiment\n\nTopics\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics > Election\n\nScore:\n\n0.737\n\nCode:\n\n20000574\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000574\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ40231\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\npublic election\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics\n\nScore:\n\n0.69\n\nCode:\n\n11000000\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/11000000\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ7163\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\npolitics\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics > Government\n\nScore:\n\n0.574\n\nCode:\n\n20000593\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000593\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ7188\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\ngovernment\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics > Government Policy > Local Government Policy\n\nScore:\n\n0.511\n\nCode:\n\n20001265\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20001265\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ1780384\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\nlocal politics\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n10.9\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n56.9\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n14.4\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n9\n\nSMOG Index\n\n12\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n9.7\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n5.8\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n5\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n20\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n21\n\n## Donald Trump\n\n00:20:23-00:20:54 (31 sec)\n\nWeak (1.155)\n\nTook a month to count the votes. I wonder what they were doing. This is worse than any third world country. There's no third world country that has elections like we have. In a rare move, NBC and ABC fake news have both said that they would not cover this speech. They knew what it was about, because of the fact that they don't like the topic, because they know how corrupt our system is and they don't want to reveal it. They and others in the media are part of a plot.\n\nSentiment\n\nTopics\n\nTopic:\n\nArts, Culture, Entertainment and Media > Mass Media > Television\n\nScore:\n\n0.536\n\nCode:\n\n20000051\n\nUrl: