to our country. Our elections were left vulnerable to being rigged and stolen, and the trust of the American people was lost. This cannot be allowed to continue.\n\nSentiment\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n7.4\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n58.4\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n10.2\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n11.5\n\nSMOG Index\n\n10.6\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n5.1\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n4.4\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n3\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n14\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n15\n\n## Donald Trump\n\n00:21:44-00:22:10 (26 sec)\n\nNo Signal (0.724)\n\nEvery American, whether you're a Republican, Democrat, independent or otherwise, should be able to agree that we deserve the most secure, honest, and fair election system anywhere in the world. Secure elections should be a partisan -- really, should just, we should be together democrats, Republicans, independents, everybody, and it should not be a partisan issue.\n\nSentiment\n\nTopics\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics\n\nScore:\n\n0.68\n\nCode:\n\n11000000\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/11000000\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ7163\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\npolitics\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics > Political Process > Political System > Democracy\n\nScore:\n\n0.574\n\nCode:\n\n20000654\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000654\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ7174\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\ndemocracy\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics > Political Process > Political Parties and Movements\n\nScore:\n\n0.532\n\nCode:\n\n20000651\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000651\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ7278\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\npolitical party\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n12\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n15.9\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n19\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n12\n\nSMOG Index\n\n12\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n12\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n6\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n5\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n16\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n18\n\n## Donald Trump\n\n00:22:10-00:22:35 (25 sec)\n\nNo Signal (0.035)\n\nIt should cause to unite us, not to divide us. This should be a cause, we should be united, not divided. In light of the brand new and irrefutable information, I have revealed tonight my administration is in the process of notifying the states whose election data was compromised by the People's Republic of China and many others.\n\nSentiment\n\nTopics\n\nTopic:\n\nScience and Technology\n\nScore:\n\n0.646\n\nCode:\n\n13000000\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/13000000\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ34104\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\nscience and technology\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n10.7\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n53\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n13.3\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n11.1\n\nSMOG Index\n\n12\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n9.8\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n5.6\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n4.6\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n17\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n19\n\n## Donald Trump\n\n00:22:35-00:23:05 (30 sec)\n\nNo Signal (0.39)\n\nWe will be working closely to mitigate any harm and we're taking swift action to ensure that sensitive voter data is better protected so we can never be bought, we can never be hacked, and we can never watch a stolen election again. Tomorrow, the Secretary of Homeland Security will hold a briefing to outline his department's recent work confirming cyber vulnerabilities in our electronic voting systems.\n\nSentiment\n\nTopics\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics > Government\n\nScore:\n\n0.583\n\nCode:\n\n20000593\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000593\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ7188\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\ngovernment\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics\n\nScore:\n\n0.571\n\nCode:\n\n11000000\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/11000000\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ7163\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\npolitics\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Medi