ic election\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics > Government\n\nScore:\n\n0.528\n\nCode:\n\n20000593\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000593\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ7188\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\ngovernment\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n11.7\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n52.3\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n14.4\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n11.9\n\nSMOG Index\n\n12\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n12\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n5\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n5\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n17\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n22\n\n## Donald Trump\n\n00:23:33-00:24:00 (27 sec)\n\nNo Signal (0.596)\n\nWe have very important elections coming up. We want those elections to be honest. I've also ordered DHS to notify every state about noncitizens on their voter rolls and direct them to remove all ineligible voters from the lists immediately. But most importantly, addressing this crisis of election security demands that Congress must pass the SAVE America Act.\n\nSentiment\n\nTopics\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics > Government\n\nScore:\n\n0.66\n\nCode:\n\n20000593\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000593\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ7188\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\ngovernment\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics\n\nScore:\n\n0.586\n\nCode:\n\n11000000\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/11000000\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ7163\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\npolitics\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nCrime, Law and Justice > Law Enforcement\n\nScore:\n\n0.574\n\nCode:\n\n20000129\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000129\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ44554\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\nlaw enforcement\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics > Government > defense > Security Measures (defense) > National Security\n\nScore:\n\n0.528\n\nCode:\n\n20000604\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000604\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ258307\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\nnational sec