lease? And hopefully there will be no corrupt mail-in ballots, which, if you watched California and so many other places, mail-in ballots are inherently corrupt. So, you would have no mail-in ballots except for illness, disability, military deployment, or travel if you're going away on business or vacation.\n\nSentiment\n\nTopics\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics > Election\n\nScore:\n\n0.645\n\nCode:\n\n20000574\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000574\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ40231\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\npublic election\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics\n\nScore:\n\n0.586\n\nCode:\n\n11000000\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/11000000\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ7163\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\npolitics\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nCrime, Law and Justice > Crime > Corruption\n\nScore:\n\n0.54\n\nCode:\n\n20000093\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000093\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ366\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\ncorruption\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nTopic:\n\nPolitics > Government\n\nScore:\n\n0.528\n\nCode:\n\n20000593\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000593\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ7188\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\ngovernment\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n8.4\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n57.1\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n9.3\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n12\n\nSMOG Index\n\n10.3\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n7\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n5.7\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n4\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n24\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n22\n\n## Donald Trump\n\n00:25:04-00:25:32 (28 sec)\n\nWeak (1.339)\n\nThese reforms are urgently needed to stop the vulnerabilities that I've mentioned. To all Americans, I ask you to pick up your phone tomorrow, call your Representatives in the House and Senate and demand that they pass the SAVE America Act without delay. Together, we will restore faith and confidence in our country, and we will be bigger, better, and stronger than ever before.\n\nSentiment\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n11.4\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n51.7\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n11.7\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n12\n\nSMOG Index\n\n12\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n11.8\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n5\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n4.8\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n16\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n19\n\n## Donald Trump\n\n00:25:32-00:25:41 (8 sec)\n\nNo Signal (0.714)\n\nThank you. God bless you. God bless our great military. And God bless America. Thank you very much.\n\nSentiment\n\nTopics\n\nTopic:\n\nReligion\n\nScore:\n\n0.536\n\nCode:\n\n12000000\n\nUrl:\n\nhttps://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/12000000\n\nWikidata\\_id:\n\nQ9174\n\nWikidata\\_label:\n\nreligion\n\nSource:\n\nIPTC Media\n\nReadability\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Grade\n\n2.2\n\nFlesch-Kincaid Ease\n\n85.7\n\nGunning-Fog Score\n\n3.7\n\nColeman-Liau Index\n\n9.3\n\nSMOG Index\n\n6.9\n\nAutomated Readability Index\n\n0.5\n\nDale-Chall Readability Score\n\n4.6\n\nSprache Readability Score\n\n1.4\n\nDale-Chall Difficult Word Score\n\n5\n\nSprache Difficult Word Count\n\n4","author":"Roll Call FiscalNote","published_date":null,"latency_ms":3050.841432999732,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}